<title>USA: Sacramento CUSDCFD 1, Calif., won by BA Securities.</title>
<headline>Sacramento CUSDCFD 1, Calif., won by BA Securities.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>BA Securities, Inc., said it won $8.090 million of Sacramento City Unified School District Community Facilities District 1, Calif., special tax refunding bonds, Series C, with a true interest cost of 5.233 percent.</p>
</text>
